  *
  *	cpu		tell DDB to use register state from the
  *			CPU specified (MULTIPROCESSOR)
+ *
+ *	lock		Dump a struct lock.
+ *
+ *	slock		Dump a struct simplelock.
+ *
+ *	uvmhistdump	Dump the UVM histories.
