wm0 at pci1 dev 1 function 0: Intel i82542 1000BASE-X Ethernet, rev. 3
wm0: interrupting at dec 6600 irq 24
wm0: Ethernet address 00:d0:b7:82:33:b0
wm0: 1000baseSX, 1000baseSX-FDX, auto

